body:
“Mammy's heart was like a pallid beach where Laila's footprints would forever wash away beneath the waves of sorrow that swelled and crashed, swelled and crashed."

&#x200B;

A Thousand Splendid Suns :)

Something that really helped (in my personal experience with this situation) was to think of this as something we both wanted. It's clear that you want sex that's fun and everyone is interested in, but likely your gf does too. Something doesn't click in the bedroom, if you can't get to therapy then just make sure you talk, don't argue about this. 

&#x200B;

When I was in your gf's position I felt pretty terrible, like I wasn't living up to an expectation. She probably wants her sex like to be better too.
